      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      551.39,
      298.2,
      639.73
    ],
    "text": "An portion of land in the name and extent mentioned below and depicted in Advanced Tracing No: MAHA/PNW/2013/1277-B dated 28.07.2013 prepared by the Senior Superintend of Surveys for Surveyor situated in the village called Beddegama, in the D.R.O\u2019s Division of Pallegampaha Palispattu Korale West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Panwila in Kandy District of the Central Province and bounded as follows:",
